  "bio": "Renowned for her immaculate illustrative tattoos, Lisa Radocchia operates with a meticulous focus on cleanliness that ensures a safe, sterile, and reassuring environment for all her clients. Situated in Redwood City, United States, Lisa infuses her ⭐art witch⭐ charm into every piece, providing not just a tattoo but a truly hygienic and artful experience. Her unwavering dedication to maintaining a pristine workspace has made her a respected figure in the tattoo community, ensuring that every client leaves with both stunning art and peace of mind.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Redwood City, California, United States"
